{
  "$schema": "https://jxsuite.com/schema/v1",
  "$id": "StylebookTooltip",
  "tagName": "main",
  "$elements": [
    {
      "$ref": "../components/jx-icon.json"
    },
    {
      "$ref": "../components/jx-tooltip.json"
    }
  ],
  "state": {
    "names": ["floppy-disk", "copy"]
  },
  "style": {
    "fontFamily": "var(--jx-font-sans)",
    "fontSize": "var(--jx-text-md)",
    "color": "var(--jx-fg)",
    "background": "var(--jx-bg)",
    "padding": "var(--jx-space-6)",
    "minHeight": "100vh",
    "& > h1": {
      "fontSize": "var(--jx-text-lg)",
      "fontWeight": "600",
      "margin": "0 0 var(--jx-space-5)"
    },
    "& > p": {
      "color": "var(--jx-fg-dim)",
      "margin": "0 0 var(--jx-space-5)",
      "maxWidth": "60ch"
    },
    "& [role=\"group\"]": {
      "display": "flex",
      "alignItems": "center",
      "gap": "var(--jx-space-3)",
      "margin": "0 0 var(--jx-space-4)"
    },
    "& [role=\"group\"] > span": {
      "width": "180px",
      "color": "var(--jx-fg-muted)",
      "fontSize": "var(--jx-text-sm)"
    },
    "& button": {
      "display": "inline-flex",
      "alignItems": "center",
      "justifyContent": "center",
      "width": "var(--jx-control-h)",
      "height": "var(--jx-control-h)",
      "padding": "0",
      "appearance": "none",
      "border": "1px solid var(--jx-border)",
      "borderRadius": "var(--jx-radius-sm)",
      "background": "var(--jx-bg-input)",
      "color": "var(--jx-fg)",
      "cursor": "pointer"
    },
    "& button:focus-visible": {
      "outline": "var(--jx-focus-ring)",
      "outlineOffset": "1px"
    }
  },
  "children": [
    {
      "tagName": "h1",
      "textContent": "jx-tooltip"
    },
    {
      "tagName": "p",
      "textContent": "A tip is a hint popover: it can sit over an open menu explaining a row, because a hint does not dismiss an auto popover the way a second auto one would. It is never focusable, and it never names itself onto anything — the control points at it with aria-describedby, which resolves because the kit is light DOM."
    },
    {
      "tagName": "p",
      "textContent": "Both buttons below are icon-only, so the tip is the only sentence a reader gets. The first is wired the declarative way, with interestfor on the control; the second names its control with for. Both work on every engine — where interest invokers are missing the element binds the control it is wired to itself — and either way the tip stays up for as long as the pointer or the focus is on it, and Escape puts it away."
    },
    {
      "tagName": "div",
      "attributes": {
        "role": "group",
        "aria-label": "Declarative"
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "tagName": "span",
          "textContent": "interestfor"
        },
        {
          "tagName": "button",
          "attributes": {
            "type": "button",
            "aria-label": "Save",
            "aria-describedby": "sb-tip-save",
            "interestfor": "sb-tip-save"
          },
          "children": [
            {
              "tagName": "jx-icon",
              "$props": {
                "name": "floppy-disk"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "tagName": "jx-tooltip",
          "id": "sb-tip-save",
          "children": [
            {
              "tagName": "span",
              "textContent": "Save the file — ⌘S"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "tagName": "div",
      "attributes": {
        "role": "group",
        "aria-label": "Fallback"
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "tagName": "span",
          "textContent": "for, with an arrow"
        },
        {
          "tagName": "button",
          "id": "sb-copy-button",
          "attributes": {
            "type": "button",
            "aria-label": "Copy",
            "aria-describedby": "sb-tip-copy"
          },
          "children": [
            {
              "tagName": "jx-icon",
              "$props": {
                "name": "copy"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "tagName": "jx-tooltip",
          "id": "sb-tip-copy",
          "$props": {
            "for": "sb-copy-button",
            "arrow": true,
            "delay": 250
          },
          "children": [
            {
              "tagName": "span",
              "textContent": "Copy the selection"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
